  "description": "High-performance RADIUS protocol engine for .NET 10.\n            Designed for low latency and minimal GC pressure using Span<T>, Memory<T>, and ArrayPool<byte>.\n            Supports Authentication, Accounting, CoA, and Disconnect-Messages with PAP, CHAP, and MS-CHAPv2.\n            This is the core library; for a full server implementation using Clean Architecture and CQRS, visit the project GitHub.",
